  "scope": "Actual backend.generate with a frozen exact-request instance-only CuDNN token, complete unload, then unmodified Native backend.load/generate; one fixed 1024-square scene at seed4471,28steps,CFG3.5,fp8/model offload.",
  "physical_bound_scope": "Guarded conditional sampled pageable-memory envelope, not an absolute instantaneous physical-memory guarantee; private commitment cap is hard, RSS ceiling sampled. Excluded allocations and external change remain covered only by declared margins/live guards.",
  "limitations": [
    "The switch driver does not retain its per-stage idle allocation/dynamic cleanup ceiling; this audit independently checks numeric allocations <=256 MiB and the retained cleanup flags.",
    "Per-member IsProcessInJob results, separate PagefileUsage/PrivateUsage values, owned-tree PID lists, supervisor PID and before/after membership lists are not retained. Recorded membership/private/RSS sums and the ready PID are checked; missing raw containment/API equality observations are not reconstructed.",
    "The retained peak is max(peak_before,peak_after); separate peaks and denied-allocation events are absent. The over-cap veto is independently recomputed from retained current/peak values only.",
    "Active member private/RSS captures are observational and non-atomic. Exact class28/current-member equality is required only at initial/readmission waiting admissions. RSS is sampled and not unique physical memory; mapped/shared/system/physical RAM is outside the private-job cap.",
    "This is a guarded experiment, not an absolute per-instant physical-memory guarantee or public application admission policy.",
    "Windows working-set/RSS excludes AWE, large-page/nonpageable and some driver/system allocations. The36GiB ceiling is sampled pageable working-set demand, not a cap on all physical memory. Global4GiB monitoring and6GiB extra remain mandatory; no claim the extra is a formal bound on every excluded category.",
    "OS/global counters are not atomic together and external processes can change memory. Stable quiescent samples and conservative minima reduce this risk; the live guards remain required.",
